    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0313" n="301" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg301"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.515/15</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the Financial Division</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Livesey</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Financial
                        Counselor of the British Embassy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Stopford</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-04">April 4, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Stopford</hi>: The Department has
                    carefully considered the suggestion in your letter of March 17, 1942<anchor
                        n="28" xml:id="d343-f1"/> that the United States Minister in Tehran be
                    authorized to support the British Minister <pb facs="0314" n="302"
                        xml:id="pg302"/> in resisting an increase in the pound sterling value of the
                    rial. It does not appear to the Department, however, that our intervention with
                    the Iranian authorities with regard to this matter would be advisable at this
                    time.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick Livesey</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d343-f1" n="28" xml:id="d343-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; for substance of letter, see telegram No. 75, March 23, 11 p.m., to
                    the Minister in Iran, <ref target="#pg300">p. 300</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
